Run python3 scripts/check_host.py from the repository root.
The suite compiles production modules against host hardware/network stubs and checks
PWM, fades, debounce, PCM, pause generations, OTA transport/lifecycle, main orchestration,
preflight/auth forwarding, and planned model dimensions. C++17 compiler and Python required.
MD5 is a deterministic test double: tests establish control flow, not cryptographic correctness.
No host test proves physical timing, DMA/flash concurrency, power behavior, or real authentication.
See doc/bench_validation.md for board acceptance.
